263	     * and country code, a space, then the national digits grouped in threes
264	     * (e.g. {@code "+61 412 345 678"}). Derived (not persisted); recomputed each
265	     * call and {@code null} when no telephone is present. See
266	     * {@link Telephones#toDisplay(String)} for the exact format.
267	     *
268	     * @return the human-formatted telephone, or {@code null} when absent
269	     */
