312	     * The owner's age band, {@code "MINOR"}, {@code "ADULT"} or {@code "SENIOR"},
313	     * derived from {@link #birthDate} measured against {@link #registrationDate}.
314	     * Derived (not persisted); recomputed each call and {@code null} when no birth
315	     * date has been supplied. See
316	     * {@link OwnerDerivations#ageBand(LocalDate, LocalDate)} for the derivation.
317	     *
318	     * @return the age band, or {@code null} when no birth date is present
319	     */
320	    @Transient
