327	     * business-day-adjusted {@link #registrationDate} (the fiscal year starts on 1 July).
328	     * Derived (not persisted); recomputed each call and {@code null} when no registration
329	     * date is present. See {@link OwnerDerivations#fiscalYear(LocalDate)} for the derivation.
