347	     * The Luhn check digit (0-9) computed over the digits in this owner's
348	     * {@link #customerCode}. Derived (not persisted); recomputed each call. See
349	     * {@link OwnerDerivations#checkDigit(String)}.
350	     *
351	     * @return the Luhn check digit, from 0 to 9
