422	    /**
423	     * The household level ceiling assigned to this owner at creation: one above the highest
424	     * {@link #getMembershipLevel() membership level} then held by an existing member of its
425	     * household, or {@code null} when the owner joined no existing household (so no ceiling
426	     * applies). Persisted, and used by {@link #getMembershipLevel()} to cap the reported
427	     * level.
